    Future plans: ah, i hope it can become a well-loved open-source project. I'm not the best at driver design, nor too interested, I hope the community can pick up where I've left off, I hope I can inspire people to make all kinds of interesting self-sustaining modules, or finding new ways to make old-things self-sustainable, or easily modular (for example, some file systems HATE having random functionality nuked. What do you mean, If I remove this search function, the entire file system collapses like a house of cards?)


